      "source": "core",
      "sourceId": "nekomata-core",
      "label": "Catwalk (Aditional Passive)",
      "description": "When another character in your squad shares the same Attribute or Faction:\n\nAfter any character inflicts Assault, increases the DMG of Nekomata's next EX Special Attack by 35%, stacking up to 2 times.",
