      "sourceId": "nekomata-mindscape_1",
      "label": "Bird Hunter (Mindscape Cinema N°1)",
      "description": "When Nekomata hits an enemy from behind, she ignores 16% of her target's Physical RES. If the enemy is Stunned, all Nekomata's attacks against them are considered back attacks.",
